WEBVTT

00:15:57.415 --> 00:16:01.276
Ask me what I did not do.

00:16:01.276 --> 00:16:06.533
I did not clip her wings, and that's all.

00:16:06.533 --> 00:16:09.415
Thank you very much.

00:16:09.415 --> 00:16:14.911
(Applause)

00:16:14.911 --> 00:16:18.911
Thank you. Thank you very much. Thank you. (Applause)